2. All Bridge v1.6 Message Types
================================================================================

Common Envelope Fields:
  protocol: "H2_CLOUD_BRIDGE"
  protocolVersion: "1.6" (required on every message; prior versions are rejected with UNSUPPORTED_VERSION)
  sessionId: "<sessionId>" (omit on H2_CONNECT_REQ)
  requestId: "<unique correlation ID>" (omitted on unsolicited push events)
  type: "<MESSAGE_TYPE>"
